WEBVTT

00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:55.010
This is making me dizzy!

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:01.800
I did it.

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:05.500
Approaching black hole. Approaching black hole.

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:23.190
Game over. Game over.

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:42.730
Welcome back, Captain Mint.

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:50.400
It was a physical hologram? I felt like I was really flying.

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:56.240
"Roll Ruler"

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:00.420
Was that the beginner level?

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:02.870
There are intermediate and advanced levels, too.

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:09.220
If you want something even harder, you can play the extra level with Linda as the terminal.

00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:10.880
I see.

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:18.390
Rio.

00:03:18.390 --> 00:03:19.300
Rina.

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:21.470
How was the space pinball?

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:23.230
It's great.

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:24.740
The owner's calling you.

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:26.060
The owner?

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:29.890
He figured something out about the people who manipulated Linda's data.

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:30.800
Really?

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:40.570
This woman is Cartia Goltschmidt.

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:42.300
Cartia Golt...

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:43.650
Goltschmidt.

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.630
I haven't heard many good things about her.

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:47.860
You know her?

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:52.540
She's a casino owner rapidly increasing her influence through games.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:54.490
She manipulated Linda's data?

00:03:54.490 --> 00:03:55.530
Her data?

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:58.670
Cartia ordered an underling to do it.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:03.030
The one who manipulated the data will be our next opponent.

00:04:03.030 --> 00:04:05.140
Our next opponent?

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:08.160
Cartia is after my Howard Resort.

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:11.140
She challenged me formally yesterday...

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:14.380
to a gate battle for Howard Resort.

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:15.850
A gate battle?

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:18.710
Then she's challenging Rio.

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:24.490
An unwritten rule prevents gate holders from refusing gate battles.

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:26.470
Surely this is an exception.

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:30.240
That sneaky woman manipulated Linda's data.

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:33.920
A gate battle will gather the attention of the world's casinos.

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:37.780
It'll be great publicity for Sky Resort.

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:40.800
But you'll be betting Howard Resort.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:43.840
There's no way you'll lose.

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:45.540
Right?

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:51.480
I'm counting on you, Rio. Howard Resort's future rests on your shoulders.

00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:53.580
What is the game?

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:57.610
Cartia sent me a message. The only thing we know now...

00:04:57.610 --> 00:05:00.750
is your opponent's name is Jack.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.290
Jack?

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:03.480
Does anyone know him?

00:05:03.480 --> 00:05:04.670
Know him?

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:07.030
His name isn't on the guest list.

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:09.420
I don't even know if it's his real name or not.

00:05:09.610 --> 00:05:12.910
If he's a gate holder, someone must have at least heard rumors.

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:18.210
Linda-san saw him. He's the one who manipulated her data.

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:19.090
That's it.

00:05:19.090 --> 00:05:20.100
That is it.

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:21.670
Linda's no good.

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:25.090
She can't remember his face.

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:29.210
If we knew who he is, we could take countermeasures against him.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:34.830
We're going to figure out who Jack is.

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:36.280
For Rio.

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:38.380
Are you getting on?

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:40.740
I am. Wait!

00:05:42.370 --> 00:05:44.860
Try to remember anything.

00:05:44.980 --> 00:05:49.600
You're the only one who saw Jack's face. Please.

00:06:00.220 --> 00:06:01.660
Did you remember something?

00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:12.350
What is this?

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:13.540
The culprit.

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:17.400
Linda, you suck at drawing.

00:06:18.630 --> 00:06:19.700
Huh?

00:06:20.890 --> 00:06:22.590
It's him!

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:31.010
10 and 9. House wins.

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:36.720
36 losses in a row. He sucks at black jack.

00:06:42.190 --> 00:06:43.420
Craps.

00:06:45.430 --> 00:06:47.120
He's got no luck with dice.

00:06:53.440 --> 00:06:55.790
He's hopeless with machines, too.

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:59.160
This guy doesn't stand a chance against Rio.

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:07.290
Are you going to accept the challenge?

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:11.440
Like Tiffany said, I think you could turn this one down.

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:15.840
You're right, but I'm used to the owner's recklessness.

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:18.130
You're too nice.

00:07:18.130 --> 00:07:19.830
That's what I like about you, though.

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:28.150
Aren't you going to answer that?

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:30.380
Hello?

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:38.550
Again.

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:40.190
Again?

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:42.070
A silent call.

00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:43.360
I've been getting them all the time recently...

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:45.720
That's awful. I wonder who it is.

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:48.350
I can't believe it's this time already.

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:53.600
This...

00:07:55.550 --> 00:08:00.420
It's the portrait from Misery's castle. What is it doing here?

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:02.590
I don't know.

00:08:02.840 --> 00:08:04.570
I'll get security.

00:08:04.570 --> 00:08:06.670
Wait. Stay here, Rina.

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:07.580
Rio...

00:08:08.430 --> 00:08:10.130
It must be Cartia.

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:15.090
She's trying to distract you from the game by scaring you.

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:16.690
That's why you're getting silent calls, too.

00:08:16.690 --> 00:08:17.980
You can't be serious.

00:08:17.980 --> 00:08:21.000
Don't worry. I'll be with you.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:22.630
Thanks, Rina.

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:24.550
The tables have turned.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:31.710
You've always warmed my lonely and cold heart.

00:08:32.560 --> 00:08:34.980
It's my turn to protect you.

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:36.670
Rina...

00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:59.390
You'll make me lose him!

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:08.940
What's wrong with you?

00:09:12.300 --> 00:09:15.500
He's gone. Are you following that man?

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:21.980
This isn't for kids. This is adult business.

00:09:22.510 --> 00:09:25.020
You're just a kid, too.

00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:41.330
Drink milk! Drink milk! Drink milk!

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:43.620
Cheese... cheese...

00:09:43.620 --> 00:09:45.260
Yogurt! Yogurt! Yogurt!

00:09:45.260 --> 00:09:47.300
But milk! Milk! Milk!

00:09:47.300 --> 00:09:49.030
I can't... breathe...!

00:09:50.910 --> 00:09:52.760
It's just oxygen deficiency.

00:09:50.910 --> 00:09:57.160
Milk... I need milk. Give me calcium...

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:57.160
It's because he's running around at 4000 meters.

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:01.400
"A supreme idiot."

00:10:01.400 --> 00:10:03.350
Rio shouldn't have any trouble with him.

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:11.050
Choco!

00:10:23.710 --> 00:10:24.280
Here.

00:10:27.510 --> 00:10:30.400
How did you do that? Magic?

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:33.730
It's not for kids.

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:36.030
Wait.

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:38.510
I'm Mint. Who are you?

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:41.770
It's almost time.

00:10:43.130 --> 00:10:44.450
Let's go, Jack.

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:45.390
What?

00:10:45.390 --> 00:10:46.460
Okay.

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:51.350
That boy is Jack?

00:11:01.060 --> 00:11:03.700
Don't you think you're too young for this?

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:07.030
I'll treat you to something over there.

00:11:07.030 --> 00:11:10.960
I don't need anything. I'm here for a gate battle.

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:12.440
Gate battle?

00:11:14.890 --> 00:11:16.240
Then you're...

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:20.950
That's right. He is Jack. Jack Mighty.

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:22.840
He is your opponent.

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:24.190
Cartia!

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:28.430
And the game is space pinball.

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:30.220
Space pinball?

00:11:30.340 --> 00:11:32.450
Hey, they're having a gate battle!

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:34.330
Sounds interesting.

00:11:34.810 --> 00:11:36.470
The rules are simple.

00:11:36.470 --> 00:11:40.370
The one who earns more points in the allotted time wins.

00:11:40.370 --> 00:11:43.890
However, you'll be playing the extra level.

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:45.770
The extra level...

00:11:45.960 --> 00:11:50.950
Howard has already accepted the terms. What do you say, Rio?

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:53.250
Will you accept the challenge?

00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:55.730
Very well.

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:57.830
As the customer wishes.

00:12:07.820 --> 00:12:09.930
Don't go easy on him just because he's a kid.

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:13.870
Mint said she saw him do something amazing.

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:15.330
I'll be careful.

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:21.870
Come in.

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:25.200
It's you. What is it?

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:27.900
Thank you for earlier.

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:28.500
What?

00:12:28.940 --> 00:12:31.170
For saving Choco.

00:12:31.510 --> 00:12:33.560
You came here just for that?

00:12:33.780 --> 00:12:36.820
Are you going to use that power against Rio?

00:12:36.820 --> 00:12:37.580
What?

00:12:37.580 --> 00:12:39.460
Magic is unfair.

00:12:39.460 --> 00:12:40.720
It's not magic.

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:42.320
It's Mighty Power.

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:45.270
It's all the same. It's against the rules.

00:12:45.270 --> 00:12:46.750
Against the rules, huh?

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:52.530
By the way, that man you were following earlier...

00:12:53.570 --> 00:12:56.550
Is Carlos Tanaka, a former dealer.

00:12:56.550 --> 00:12:58.000
I made quite the mistake.

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:05.510
In order to protect my identity, I had the robot remember a different face.

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:06.790
You did what?

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:08.240
Sorry, sorry.

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:13.010
My family has disarmed bombs for generations.

00:13:13.010 --> 00:13:15.840
I'm pretty handy with machines.

00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:17.290
Bombs?

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:19.890
I didn't like it, so I ran away.

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:22.660
I couldn't survive, though.

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:28.750
Cartia took me in off the streets, but I regret it.

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:33.000
Cartia just wants to use my Mighty Power.

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:34.880
She's a devil.

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:37.580
Why do you have those powers?

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:41.420
Everyone in my family has them. After all, we dispose of bombs.

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:46.440
We must have picked up telekinesis as a way to protect ourselves.

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:47.540
I see.

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:50.400
Sorry, but I'm going to win.

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:53.600
Cartia made me a promise.

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:57.560
If I win this game, she'll let me go.

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:03.340
Jack...

00:14:14.090 --> 00:14:15.850
Program start.

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:39.940
Phase 1.

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:44.970
Launch.

00:15:29.270 --> 00:15:30.710
Phase 2.

00:15:42.780 --> 00:15:43.910
Amazing, Rio!

00:15:43.910 --> 00:15:45.790
Keep it up, Rio-senpai!

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:46.450
Look.

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:49.410
He's deflecting the meteors away from his ship.

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:07.850
Jack's Mighty Power.

00:16:08.100 --> 00:16:09.670
Phase 3.

00:16:17.590 --> 00:16:18.590
Sharks.

00:16:18.590 --> 00:16:19.910
They're sharks!

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:41.460
Damn it!

00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:50.540
Rio-senpai, there's your chance.

00:16:57.520 --> 00:16:59.060
Stupid Rio.

00:16:59.310 --> 00:17:01.700
Rio wants to enjoy the game.

00:17:42.100 --> 00:17:43.320
How dare he!

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:46.280
Attacking your opponent doesn't violate the rules.

00:17:46.280 --> 00:17:47.340
But...

00:17:48.070 --> 00:17:50.140
She lost her port engine.

00:17:55.830 --> 00:17:59.470
Approaching black hole. Approaching black hole.

00:18:14.270 --> 00:18:16.500
You're naive.

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:17.980
I win.

00:18:18.230 --> 00:18:20.050
I'm just getting started!

00:18:34.530 --> 00:18:35.510
Rio!

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:16.190
What's the time?

00:19:16.190 --> 00:19:17.730
There's one more minute.

00:19:34.760 --> 00:19:36.390
Game set.

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:39.220
Rio won.

00:19:40.790 --> 00:19:42.080
I lost.

00:19:44.400 --> 00:19:47.670
Just a touch of sweetness! Just a touch! Where is it?

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:49.620
How did it go?

00:19:51.910 --> 00:19:53.420
I bumped into her.

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:02.310
Phase 4. Phase 4.

00:20:02.310 --> 00:20:03.130
Linda!

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:12.900
Rio!

00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:14.000
Mint!

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:30.080
Jack!

00:20:31.210 --> 00:20:32.440
Hurry!

00:20:32.570 --> 00:20:34.860
I'll hold off this meteor!

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:36.050
Got it!

00:21:02.540 --> 00:21:03.920
What an amazing girl.

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:07.630
She's a skilled roll ruler.

00:21:07.810 --> 00:21:10.860
Of course, that's why you hired her.

00:21:10.860 --> 00:21:13.060
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:21:19.470 --> 00:21:22.520
Expect clear skies today. Clear skies.

00:21:22.520 --> 00:21:25.160
Aya, apologize to your parents...

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:27.010
I lost.

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:29.990
You're the hero of the day.

00:21:29.990 --> 00:21:31.690
That's right, Jack.

00:21:31.940 --> 00:21:34.080
Thank you for saving us.

00:21:34.550 --> 00:21:36.090
Close your eyes.

00:21:36.090 --> 00:21:36.910
What?

00:21:37.500 --> 00:21:39.360
Just do it.

00:21:40.680 --> 00:21:42.090
Here's a kiss of thanks.

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:45.360
It's just your bear.

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:47.840
We're too young for that.

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:30.060
Rio-kun, antlions do not eat.

00:23:30.060 --> 00:23:31.280
Is he on a diet?

00:23:31.280 --> 00:23:32.730
They do not have mouths.

00:23:32.730 --> 00:23:34.680
They are paying for their larval stage.

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:36.470
Larva?

00:23:36.620 --> 00:23:42.910
"Antlion"

00:23:36.880 --> 00:23:39.330
You can count on me in the next episode!
